{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"不能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"他几乎藏不住喜欢，怕太急弄坏两人的自在，最后还是停住了。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"他想把眼下的好留久些，又怕说多了让对方为难，最后还是留了些话。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"对方近来总愿意和他待着，他渐渐觉得对方也许需要他的陪伴。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"上回露了心意，对方仍愿和他亲近，他想大方回应，也盼两人能长久相处。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"他担心对方有天不再需要自己，也不愿再和他待着，便不敢往下想。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"轻松过去后，他想，就算对方有时不需要他陪，他也愿意继续陪着，不再藏起喜欢。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"他知道再用心也不能保证两人以后一直亲近，还是想多陪对方一会儿。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"他怕对方有天不再需要自己，想把喜欢藏回去，可装作不在乎反而更难受。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"他还是舍不得，也不知道两人以后会怎样，但不再逼自己要一句永远不变的话。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"读不完主要集中在 S01、S05、S06、S07、S09、S12、S14，基本只能抓住主句和少量词，次组信息来不及完整阅读。S06 的情绪词堆叠尤其容易压过因果：能看出对方没有退开，却不容易理解他为什么又开始摇摆；S01 则只读主句时，不知道他为什么突然这么想靠近。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f2641aa7-d9c2-45f9-8994-bb44f0514b1a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T152433255806Z", "elapsed_seconds": 178.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T15:27:31.983464+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "de9332db2b09ecea36cc1b31ba6b6f4004996d3c72016ef77b92e3168662af5a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885